{"id":"n90052-1-8","stage":5,"title":"야생 · 野生","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90052-1-8-1","ko":"이 산삼은 유난히 비싸군요.","zh":"这株人参的价格真高啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"산삼은","meaning":"山参","explanation":"산삼：山参；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"산삼","audio":"/audio/185f6c328928eef40443.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61778","senseId":"1","lemma":"산삼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산삼은","audio":"/audio/2c525b4daeeb0a7808bb.mp3"}},{"text":"유난히","meaning":"特别，异常，格外","explanation":"유난히：特别，异常，格外。","readings":[{"term":"유난히","audio":"/audio/a981b34035c6d45ef9ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72421","senseId":"1","lemma":"유난히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유난히","audio":"/audio/a981b34035c6d45ef9ae.mp3"}},{"text":"비싸군요.","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비싸군요","audio":"/audio/35c482eef6b2a64e4e11.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"185f6c328928eef4","term":"산삼","zh":"山参","audio":"/audio/185f6c328928eef40443.mp3","entryId":"61778","definition":"自然生长于深山，药效非常好的参。","pronunciation":["산삼"]},{"id":"a981b34035c6d45e","term":"유난히","zh":"特别，异常，格外","audio":"/audio/a981b34035c6d45ef9ae.mp3","entryId":"72421","definition":"状态、性格、行为等与平常非常不同地。","pronunciation":["유ː난히"]},{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"贵","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"物品的价格或做某事所花的费用高于一般水平。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]}],"audio":"/audio/69ff1cc4b13a669dcfd0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90052-1-8-2","ko":"야생에서 자란 자연산 삼이라 그래요.","zh":"因为这是生长在野外的天然人参啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"야생에서","meaning":"野生","explanation":"야생：野生；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"야생","audio":"/audio/5579850c7d6630b6613b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90052","senseId":"1","lemma":"야생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야생에서","audio":"/audio/d80598684791874b8aab.mp3"}},{"text":"자란","meaning":"生长","explanation":"자라다：生长；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"자라다","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66317","senseId":"1","lemma":"자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자란","audio":"/audio/5a957f1742fe78dc30b1.mp3"}},{"text":"자연산","meaning":"野生，天然","explanation":"자연산：野生，天然。","readings":[{"term":"자연산","audio":"/audio/c813f5029690c8940796.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73495","senseId":"1","lemma":"자연산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자연산","audio":"/audio/c813f5029690c8940796.mp3"}},{"text":"삼이라","meaning":"参","explanation":"삼：参；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"삼","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61855","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼이라","audio":"/audio/d8b096e1429c73d08636.mp3"}},{"text":"그래요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래요","audio":"/audio/b6894238d8eae709ebfd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5579850c7d6630b6","term":"야생","zh":"野生","audio":"/audio/5579850c7d6630b6613b.mp3","entryId":"90052","definition":"在山或原野中自然而然地长出长大；或指那样的动植物。","pronunciation":["야ː생"]},{"id":"17c36cbe99642c8e","term":"자라다","zh":"生长","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3","entryId":"66317","definition":"生物体部分或全部渐渐变大。","pronunciation":["자라다"]},{"id":"c813f5029690c894","term":"자연산","zh":"野生，天然","audio":"/audio/c813f5029690c8940796.mp3","entryId":"73495","definition":"并非由人类种植培育的，而是自然中自己生长的东西。","pronunciation":["자연산"]},{"id":"3cd6c40aac5fd42e","term":"삼","zh":"参","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3","entryId":"61855","definition":"人参或山参。","pronunciation":["삼"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/d982541897db2532c4a1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.287,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90052","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":157,"sequenceScore":3.1137,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为这是生长在野外的天然人参啊。","这株人参的价格真高啊。","裕敏好像太敏感了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这株人参的价格真高啊。","裕敏好像太敏感了。","因为这是生长在野外的天然人参啊。"],"answer":2}]}
